WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:08.071
This planned card asks for an error message and an account lockout. The first comparison offers the lockout as extra work.

00:00:09.028 --> 00:00:19.348
The login agent hands over with the lockout complete. Meanwhile, the catalog card keeps changing every half second. Those unrelated updates no longer hold up the merge comparison.

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:28.340
The new comparison finishes while catalog updates continue. The login work now covers the planned card, and the merge is ready to approve.
